    "enUS": {
      "description": "<As the creature falls, its head comes toppling off. It seems as if it has been reattached several times, and the connection gets weaker with each reconnection.\r\n\r\nSomeone in the Undercity would know more about this unique abomination.>",
      "dialogue": {
        "d4fec1235dadb7277549": "What have we here?",
        "fb59edb287a4d4623c23": "Oho! I believe I know this head. A cruel joke by our Dark Lady. A delicious one at that.\n\nI think I have a use for this."
      },
      "summary": "Deliver the Abominable Head to Master Apothecary Faranell within the Undercity.",
      "title": "Unending Torment",
